<translate>
==== HitFloorSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. Indicates the sound that will be played when the item hits the floor.
<syntaxhighlight lang='Java'>
HitFloorSound = AxeHit,
</syntaxhighlight>
